    "detailed_description": "<strong>Let's change all of Japan to Gunma.<br>The definitive edition of the Gunma simulation game.<br>Everyone can play!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story mode</h2>You become Gunma and collect special products.<br>If you get a special product, you can get G (GUNMA).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119260/extras/d18f5ad3aac857b40af3477cf4faceec.avif?t=1755140063\" width=400 height=300 /></span><br><br>Next, select the prefecture you want to change to Gunma.<br>Then use G (GUNMA) to draw the gacha.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119260/extras/04fdb72c1313cf1fdfb0795cbbb96403.avif?t=1755140063\" width=400 height=300 /></span><br><br>The people of the selected prefecture will change to Gunma for the population of the municipalities that came out in Gacha.<br>When everyone changes to Gunma, the prefecture changes to Gunma.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119260/extras/566965280748ec5f3d735e5d0c0dc901.avif?t=1755140063\" width=400 height=300 /></span>",
